# Static analysis — finish checklist

## When to run

After Java or SQL migration changes. Skip docs-only / `.mdc`-only edits.

## Required commands

```bash
./mvnw -B clean test
```

Compiles, runs formatter (`process-sources`), and tests when present.

Faster compile check:

```bash
./mvnw -B clean compile
```

## Formatting

```bash
./mvnw -B process-sources
```

[`resources/formatter.xml`](../../resources/formatter.xml) — [engage-format-imports.mdc](engage-format-imports.mdc).

## IDE diagnostics

`ReadLints` on changed files.

## Do not finish while

- `./mvnw clean compile` fails.
- New linter errors in touched files.
